# libFuzzer scratch output -- raw console logs from ad hoc fuzzing runs
# (fuzz-0.log style, one per parallel worker) and each target's own corpus/
# crash-artifact directories. The harness sources under fuzz/*.cpp are real,
# tracked project content; everything below is disposable output from
# actually running them and doesn't belong in source control or in a
# delivered copy of the tool -- see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md ROADMAP item 2.
fuzz-*.log
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
